{
  "slug": "claude-paste",
  "name": "Claude Paste",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Paste clipboard screenshots into Claude Code automatically. Zero dependencies, cross-platform.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `configure` (Configure Claude-Paste settings (freshness threshold for screenshot detection))\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `claude-paste`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-paste@claude-community` from `mailfnguides-del/Claude-Paste`.",
